  <!-- EN:
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]需要人手来帮忙[dutyDescription]。\n\n[asker_pronoun]请你借给[asker_objective][colonistCountToLend]，为期[lendForDays]天。\n\n[willSendShuttle]</li>
