    <li>colonistCountToLend(colonistsToLendCount==1)->1 名殖民者[minAgeOrOlder]</li>
    <li>colonistCountToLend(colonistsToLendCount>1)->[colonistsToLendCount] 名殖民者[minAgeOrOlder]</li>
    <li>willSendShuttle->[asker_pronoun]会派穿梭机来接这些[colonists]。</li>
    <li>colonists(colonistsToLendCount==1)->殖民者</li>
    <li>colonists(colonistsToLendCount>1)->殖民者</li>
    <li>minAgeOrOlder(minAge==0)-></li>
    <li>minAgeOrOlder(minAge>0)->[minAge] 岁以上</li>
    <li>pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount==1)->有</li>
    <li>pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount>1)->有</li>
  -->
  <PawnLend.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
    <li>questDescription(asker_factionLeader==True)->[asker_faction_name]的[asker_faction_leaderTitle][asker_nameFull]需要人手帮忙[dutyDescription]。\n\n[asker_pronoun]要求你将[colonistCountToLend]借给[asker_objective][lendForDays]天。\n\n[willSendShuttle]</li>
    <li>disease->流感</li>
    <li>disease->瘟疫</li>
    <li>disease->疟疾</li>
    <li>disease->伤口感染</li>
    <li>questDescription(asker_royalInCurrentFaction==True)->[asker_faction_name]的[asker_royalTitleInCurrentFaction][asker_nameFull]需要一些人手来帮忙[dutyRoyalDescription]。\n\n[asker_pronoun]正请求你将[colonistCountToLend]派遣去为[asker_objective]服务[lendForDays]天。\n\n[willSendShuttle]</li>
    <li>colonistCountToLend(colonistsToLendCount==1)->一位[minAgeOrOlder]殖民者</li>
    <li>colonistCountToLend(colonistsToLendCount>1)->[colonistsToLendCount]位[minAgeOrOlder]殖民者</li>
    <li>willSendShuttle->[asker_pronoun]将会派出穿梭机来接[colonists]。</li>
    <li>colonists(colonistsToLendCount==1)->殖民者</li>
    <li>colonists(colonistsToLendCount>1)->殖民者</li>
    <li>minAgeOrOlder(minAge==0)-></li>
    <li>minAgeOrOlder(minAge>0)->[minAge]岁或更年长的</li>
    <li>pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount==1)->已经</li>
    <li>pawnListHaveConjugation(colonistsToLendCount>1)->已经</li>
  </PawnLend.questDescriptionRules.rulesStrings>
